Artifact Review:
- review_id: {{reviewId}}
- review_round_id: {{roundId}}
- round: {{round}}
- status: {{status}}
- submitted: {{submitted}}/{{total}}
- decision_ready: {{decisionReady}}
- advisory: blocking={{advisory.blocking}}; risk={{advisory.risk}}; suggestion={{advisory.suggestion}}; unresolved_blocking={{advisory.unresolvedBlocking}}
- agent_failures: environment={{failures.environment}}; provider={{failures.provider}}; reviewer={{failures.reviewer}}; unknown={{failures.unknown}}
- earlier_artifacts: {{earlierArtifacts}}
{{#each repeatedAdvisories}}
- repeated_advisory: [{{severity}}] x{{count}} rounds={{rounds}} {{body}}
{{/each}}
Participants:
{{#each participants}}
- {{actorName}} ({{binding}}{{#if agent}}, agent{{/if}})
  - vote: {{vote}}
{{#if agent}}
  - status: {{status}}
{{#if attempt}}
  - attempt: {{attempt}}; provider: {{provider}}
{{/if}}
{{#if failure}}
  - failure: {{failure}}
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
{{#if decisionIntent}}
  - decision_intent: {{decisionIntent}}
{{/if}}
{{#unlessNil implementationEvidenceReferenced}}
  - implementation_evidence_referenced: {{implementationEvidenceReferenced}}
{{/unlessNil}}
{{#each comments}}
  - comment [{{severity}}]: {{body}}
{{/each}}
{{/each}}
{{#if runner}}
- Runner (decision{{#if runner.automatic}}, automatic{{/if}})
  - vote: {{runner.vote}}
{{#if runner.comment}}
  - comment: {{runner.comment}}
{{/if}}
{{/if}}
Decision:
{{#ifDecision decision "awaiting_runner"}}
- All assigned reviews are submitted: {{decision.approved}}/{{decision.decisionTotal}} decision votes approved; {{decision.advisoryTotal}} advisory vote{{#unlessOne decision.advisoryTotal}}s{{/unlessOne}} {{#ifOne decision.advisoryTotal}}was{{else}}were{{/ifOne}} recorded.
- The policy can still reach unanimous approval. You are the Runner for this Run, and your decision vote is pending.
Conclusion:
- The Artifact has not been accepted and the Run has not advanced. As the Runner, review every comment above, then cast your vote explicitly.
{{/ifDecision}}
{{#ifDecision decision "result"}}
- unanimous approval {{#if decision.passed}}was reached{{else}}was not reached{{/if}}: {{decision.approved}}/{{decision.decisionTotal}} decision votes approved; {{decision.advisoryTotal}} advisory vote{{#unlessOne decision.advisoryTotal}}s{{/unlessOne}} {{#ifOne decision.advisoryTotal}}was{{else}}were{{/ifOne}} recorded and did not affect the decision.
Conclusion:
{{#if decision.passed}}
- This review round passed unanimously, so the reviewed Artifact was accepted and the Run advanced to the next step.
{{else}}
- This review round did not pass because unanimous approval was not reached; revise the Artifact using the comments above, provide a revision summary, and report the new Artifact to start the next round.
{{/if}}
{{/ifDecision}}
{{#ifDecision decision "failed"}}
- Review is blocked because {{decision.failedAssignments}} Agent Assignment{{#unlessOne decision.failedAssignments}}s have{{else}} has{{/unlessOne}} failed.
Conclusion:
- The Artifact has not been accepted and the Run has not advanced. Inspect the failure in View, then retry the failed Agent Assignment.
{{/ifDecision}}
{{#ifDecision decision "pending"}}
- No decision has been reached; {{decision.remaining}} review submission{{#unlessOne decision.remaining}}s{{/unlessOne}} remain.
Conclusion:
- This review round is still in progress; keep waiting with the same review_id until every assigned reviewer submits.
{{/ifDecision}}
